<title>USA: Manhattan Beach, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Manhattan Beach, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $4.615 million of Manhattan Beach, Calif., 1996 wastewater improvement project certificates of participation, with a true interest cost of 5.78 percent.</p>
